7. PLAYING ON SERVERS, AND MODS

   Many servers have rules about which mods and clients are allowed. It is your responsibility to
   follow the rules of the servers you play on. FMG-PLUGINS is not responsible if a server kicks
   or bans you. The same goes for mods you install for any game: it is your choice which mods you
   use.


